          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 25,
              "body": "In my experience, if you put something in the MNAME that doesn't respond to queries, customer will complain because zonecheckers. The point I was trying to make is that it's good if there's a way to say \"I'm not putting anything here, because I have nothing to put\". (This would be true even without Dynamic Update existing.)\r\n\r\nBut, not feeling strongly.",
              "createdAt": "2025-06-18T08:11:52Z",
              "updatedAt": "2025-06-18T08:11:52Z"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDONORxZs6vIXle",
          "commit": {
            "abbreviatedOid": "91b351a"
          },
